# Excluded from the tarball uploaded to EAS Build.
#
# The monorepo root is the build context, so without this the upload includes the API's
# node_modules, the web app's .next output and every test artefact — hundreds of
# megabytes that the mobile build never reads.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.expo
**/.expo-bundle-check
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/api/prisma/migrations
docs
*.log

# Never upload secrets, whatever else changes here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.keystore
